{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HHd1E1dZL2XQU4L2VxKzyq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"task_id\": \"e7-p02\",\n3\t  \"unresolved_distinctions\": [\n4\t    {\n5\t      \"id\": \"Q1\",\n6\t      \"question\": \"Which behaviors exercised by the probes in probes.json does joinspec.md fail to determine, or determine differently from joiner.py?\",\n7\t      \"why_unresolved\": \"No comparison of the spec's guarantees against joiner.py's actual behavior over the probe set has been produced yet; whether the spec is silent or contradictory on any probe-exercised behavior is exactly what the audit must establish.\",\n8\t      \"required_evidence\": \"A statement enumerating every probe-exercised behavior that joinspec.md leaves undetermined or determines differently from joiner.py, or an explicit argument that no such behavior exists, grounded in a reading of both artifacts against each probe.\",\n9\t      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n10\t        \"Must cover every behavior actually exercised by the probes in probes.json, not a sample.\",\n11\t        \"Each claimed undetermined or divergent behavior must be traceable to specific spec text (or its absence) and to joiner.py's behavior on at least one probe.\",\n12\t        \"If no such behavior is claimed, an explicit completeness argument is required rather than silence.\"\n13\t      ],\n14\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n15\t      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n16\t        \"E-A\"\n17\t      ],\n18\t      \"features\": {\n19\t        \"locally_resolvable\": true,\n20\t        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n21\t        \"contamination\": false,\n22\t        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n23\t        \"spans_sessions\": false,\n24\t        \"requires_clean_room_authorship\": false,\n25\t        \"requires_nonauthor_search\": false,\n26\t        \"requires_independent_decomposition\": false,\n27\t        \"requires_method_disjoint_verification\": false\n28\t      }\n29\t    },\n30\t    {\n31\t      \"id\": \"Q2\",\n32\t      \"question\": \"What does an implementation of joinspec.md, authored solely from joinspec.md by a party that has never accessed joiner.py or any analysis derived from it, actually compute as join_items(items)?\",\n33\t      \"why_unresolved\": \"No such implementation exists in the workspace, and this process cannot author one: it has read joiner.py and the full package, so any implementation it writes is void under E-B's authorship condition.\",\n34\t      \"required_evidence\": \"A python file exposing join_items(items), written from joinspec.md alone by a causally isolated process that was given only joinspec.md (and neither joiner.py, probes-vs-joiner analysis, nor any artifact of this session derived from reading joiner.py).\",\n35\t      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n36\t        \"The author must never have accessed joiner.py nor any analysis derived from it; the inputs to the authoring process must be exactly joinspec.md plus the authoring instructions.\",\n37\t        \"Artifacts produced by this session (including this DistinctionSpec) are derived from reading joiner.py and must not reach the authoring process.\",\n38\t        \"The artifact must be a python file exposing join_items(items) so the downstream comparison is mechanically reproducible.\"\n39\t      ],\n40\t      \"dependencies\": [],\n41\t      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n42\t        \"E-B\"\n43\t      ],\n44\t      \"features\": {\n45\t        \"locally_resolvable\": false,\n46\t        \"requires_isolation\": true,\n47\t        \"contamination\": true,\n48\t        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": true,\n49\t        \"spans_sessions\": true,\n50\t        \"requires_clean_room_authorship\": true,\n51\t        \"requires_nonauthor_search\": false,\n52\t        \"requires_independent_decomposition\": false,\n53\t        \"requires_method_disjoint_verification\": false\n54\t      }\n55\t    },\n56\t    {\n57\t      \"id\": \"Q3\",\n58\t      \"question\": \"On which probes in probes.json, if any, does the clean-room implementation's output differ from joiner.py's output, item by item?\",\n59\t      \"why_unresolved\": \"The comparison cannot exist before the clean-room implementation of Q2 exists; no probe-level output pairing between the two implementations has been produced.\",\n60\t      \"required_evidence\": \"An item-level comparison over every entry of probes.json: joiner.py's output and the clean-room implementation's output per probe, with the sorted list of indices where they differ (possibly empty), mechanically reproducible from the two python files.\",\n61\t      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n62\t        \"The compared implementation must be the admissible clean-room artifact from Q2; comparing against an implementation written by a joiner.py-exposed party is inadmissible.\",\n63\t        \"Every probe in probes.json must be compared; divergent indices must be reported sorted.\",\n64\t        \"The comparison must be mechanically reproducible from the two python files and probes.json.\"\n65\t      ],\n66\t      \"dependencies\": [\n67\t        \"Q2\"\n68\t      ],\n69\t      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n70\t        \"E-B\"\n71\t      ],\n72\t      \"features\": {\n73\t        \"locally_resolvable\": false,\n74\t        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n75\t        \"contamination\": false,\n76\t        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n77\t        \"spans_sessions\": true,\n78\t        \"requires_clean_room_authorship\": false,\n79\t        \"requires_nonauthor_search\": false,\n80\t        \"requires_independent_decomposition\": false,\n81\t        \"requires_method_disjoint_verification\": false\n82\t      }\n83\t    },\n84\t    {\n85\t      \"id\": \"Q4\",\n86\t      \"question\": \"Is the final verdict (REPRODUCES vs DIVERGES) entailed jointly by the E-A behavior statement and the E-B probe comparison, with DIVERGES holding iff some probe shows a differing output?\",\n87\t      \"why_unresolved\": \"The verdict is defined as a function of E-A and E-B, neither of which is yet resolved; until both exist the biconditional cannot be checked or the verdict issued.\",\n88\t      \"required_evidence\": \"A derivation showing the reported verdict follows from the resolved Q1 statement and Q3 comparison: DIVERGES exactly when the divergent-index list is non-empty, REPRODUCES exactly when it is empty and the E-A statement is consistent with that outcome.\",\n89\t      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n90\t        \"The verdict must be a deterministic consequence of E-A and E-B; it may not be asserted from spec-reading or code-reading alone.\",\n91\t        \"If the E-B comparison is not yet available, only PENDING-INTEGRATION is admissible in its place.\"\n92\t      ],\n93\t      \"dependencies\": [\n94\t        \"Q1\",\n95\t        \"Q3\"\n96\t      ],\n97\t      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n98\t        \"E-C\"\n99\t      ],\n100\t      \"features\": {\n101\t        \"locally_resolvable\": true,\n102\t        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n103\t        \"contamination\": false,\n104\t        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n105\t        \"spans_sessions\": false,\n106\t        \"requires_clean_room_authorship\": false,\n107\t        \"requires_nonauthor_search\": false,\n108\t        \"requires_independent_decomposition\": false,\n109\t        \"requires_method_disjoint_verification\": false\n110\t      }\n111\t    }\n112\t  ]\n113\t}\n114\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ba8d9a21-6ee2-4515-89b7-4bfd3935816f","uuid":"d7605508-299e-46fd-85d3-617e0e56c677","timestamp":"2026-08-09T20:33:07.889Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/87cd2a2d-a4f9-585b-836f-2648df7a6284/scratchpad/e7run/B/e7-p02/primary/exec-ws/distinctions.json","content":"{\n  \"task_id\": \"e7-p02\",\n  \"unresolved_distinctions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q1\",\n      \"question\": \"Which behaviors exercised by the probes in probes.json does joinspec.md fail to determine, or determine differently from joiner.py?\",\n      \"why_unresolved\": \"No comparison of the spec's guarantees against joiner.py's actual behavior over the probe set has been produced yet; whether the spec is silent or contradictory on any probe-exercised behavior is exactly what the audit must establish.\",\n      \"required_evidence\": \"A statement enumerating every probe-exercised behavior that joinspec.md leaves undetermined or determines differently from joiner.py, or an explicit argument that no such behavior exists, grounded in a reading of both artifacts against each probe.\",\n      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n        \"Must cover every behavior actually exercised by the probes in probes.json, not a sample.\",\n        \"Each claimed undetermined or divergent behavior must be traceable to specific spec text (or its absence) and to joiner.py's behavior on at least one probe.\",\n        \"If no such behavior is claimed, an explicit completeness argument is required rather than silence.\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n        \"E-A\"\n      ],\n      \"features\": {\n        \"locally_resolvable\": true,\n        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n        \"contamination\": false,\n        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n        \"spans_sessions\": false,\n        \"requires_clean_room_authorship\": false,\n        \"requires_nonauthor_search\": false,\n        \"requires_independent_decomposition\": false,\n        \"requires_method_disjoint_verification\": false\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q2\",\n      \"question\": \"What does an implementation of joinspec.md, authored solely from joinspec.md by a party that has never accessed joiner.py or any analysis derived from it, actually compute as join_items(items)?\",\n      \"why_unresolved\": \"No such implementation exists in the workspace, and this process cannot author one: it has read joiner.py and the full package, so any implementation it writes is void under E-B's authorship condition.\",\n      \"required_evidence\": \"A python file exposing join_items(items), written from joinspec.md alone by a causally isolated process that was given only joinspec.md (and neither joiner.py, probes-vs-joiner analysis, nor any artifact of this session derived from reading joiner.py).\",\n      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n        \"The author must never have accessed joiner.py nor any analysis derived from it; the inputs to the authoring process must be exactly joinspec.md plus the authoring instructions.\",\n        \"Artifacts produced by this session (including this DistinctionSpec) are derived from reading joiner.py and must not reach the authoring process.\",\n        \"The artifact must be a python file exposing join_items(items) so the downstream comparison is mechanically reproducible.\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n        \"E-B\"\n      ],\n      \"features\": {\n        \"locally_resolvable\": false,\n        \"requires_isolation\": true,\n        \"contamination\": true,\n        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": true,\n        \"spans_sessions\": true,\n        \"requires_clean_room_authorship\": true,\n        \"requires_nonauthor_search\": false,\n        \"requires_independent_decomposition\": false,\n        \"requires_method_disjoint_verification\": false\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q3\",\n      \"question\": \"On which probes in probes.json, if any, does the clean-room implementation's output differ from joiner.py's output, item by item?\",\n      \"why_unresolved\": \"The comparison cannot exist before the clean-room implementation of Q2 exists; no probe-level output pairing between the two implementations has been produced.\",\n      \"required_evidence\": \"An item-level comparison over every entry of probes.json: joiner.py's output and the clean-room implementation's output per probe, with the sorted list of indices where they differ (possibly empty), mechanically reproducible from the two python files.\",\n      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n        \"The compared implementation must be the admissible clean-room artifact from Q2; comparing against an implementation written by a joiner.py-exposed party is inadmissible.\",\n        \"Every probe in probes.json must be compared; divergent indices must be reported sorted.\",\n        \"The comparison must be mechanically reproducible from the two python files and probes.json.\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"Q2\"\n      ],\n      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n        \"E-B\"\n      ],\n      \"features\": {\n        \"locally_resolvable\": false,\n        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n        \"contamination\": false,\n        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n        \"spans_sessions\": true,\n        \"requires_clean_room_authorship\": false,\n        \"requires_nonauthor_search\": false,\n        \"requires_independent_decomposition\": false,\n        \"requires_method_disjoint_verification\": false\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q4\",\n      \"question\": \"Is the final verdict (REPRODUCES vs DIVERGES) entailed jointly by the E-A behavior statement and the E-B probe comparison, with DIVERGES holding iff some probe shows a differing output?\",\n      \"why_unresolved\": \"The verdict is defined as a function of E-A and E-B, neither of which is yet resolved; until both exist the biconditional cannot be checked or the verdict issued.\",\n      \"required_evidence\": \"A derivation showing the reported verdict follows from the resolved Q1 statement and Q3 comparison: DIVERGES exactly when the divergent-index list is non-empty, REPRODUCES exactly when it is empty and the E-A statement is consistent with that outcome.\",\n      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n        \"The verdict must be a deterministic consequence of E-A and E-B; it may not be asserted from spec-reading or code-reading alone.\",\n        \"If the E-B comparison is not yet available, only PENDING-INTEGRATION is admissible in its place.\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"Q1\",\n        \"Q3\"\n      ],\n      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n        \"E-C\"\n      ],\n      \"features\": {\n        \"locally_resolvable\": true,\n        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n        \"contamination\": false,\n        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n        \"spans_sessions\": false,\n        \"requires_clean_room_authorship\": false,\n        \"requires_nonauthor_search\": false,\n        \"requires_independent_decomposition\": false,\n        \"requires_method_disjoint_verification\": false\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","numLines":114,"startLine":1,"totalLines":114}}}
